  invalidTitle: "Precedence never licenses an ambiguous chain",
  invalidBody: "a < b < c is rejected; write a < b && b < c. Ambiguous overloaded operator references need a type annotation. Unary * and - are distinguished by position from binary multiplication and subtraction, and parentheses are required whenever a different grouping is intended.",
